i.e. $|\overline{A_0A_1}|| < \ell(\widearc{\xi_{\bA}}) - |\overline{A_0A_1}|$.
Hence, $\ell(m')$ is less than the
length of the shortest counter-clockwise collision-free co-motion from $\bA\bB_0$ to $\bA\bB_1$.

