\begin{abstract}
%There are several types of learners, such as visual learners.  
Visual learners think in pictures rather than words and learn best when they utilize representations based on graphs, tables, charts, maps, colors and diagrams.
%\footnote{reviewer: "Visual learners think in pictures rather than words, and learn best when they utilize representations based on graphs and diagrams" is a bold claim.
