\vspace{-0.5em}
\section{Package Design}
\vspace{-0.5em}
Our software provides a simple interface for solving satisfiability problems by automatically generating the underlying SMT-LIB commands and interpreting the solver responses. The basic unit of an SMT formula is the expression, which implements a tree structure capable of representing arbitrarily complex formulae.% (Figure \ref{fig:expr-tree}).
%
