\section{EEmo-Bench Task Designs}

Based on the constructed dataset and emotional attributes, we propose \textbf{EEmo-Bench} to comprehensively evaluate the evoked emotion understanding abilities of multiple MLLMs from four tasks, including \textbf{Perception}, \textbf{Ranking}, \textbf{Description}, and \textbf{Assessment}. The evaluation samples are enumerated in Fig.\ref{fig:examples}.


\subsection{Perception} \label{sec: perception}

The perception task concentrates on evaluating the evoked emotion perception abilities of MLLMs, focusing on their accuracy in question answering related to emotion category and emotional attributes (see Fig. \ref{fig:pipeline} (c) (d)). 
% To ensure a comprehensive assessment, we categorize questions into four aspects and extend the task from single-image analysis to image-pair comparison.
