The queries for UPPAAL SMC use the formal language of MITL (Metric Interval Temporal Logic)~\cite{dokhanchi2015metric} and the queries for CMC use CTL (Computation Tree Logic)~\cite{reynolds2001axiomatization}; we refer to the UPPAAL documentation~\cite{UPPAALdoc}
%\footnote{See \url{https://docs.uppaal.org/language-reference/query-syntax/}.} 
for query syntax and semantics.
