\subsection{Biases caused by telemetry loss} % in experiments}
\label{subs:loss_experimentation_examples}
In this section, we describe real experiments in \emph{Skype} and \emph{OneNote}, illustrating different 
types of bias caused by telemetry loss. These experiments were run at scale having more than a million
observations in each variant.
% Detail internal information about the examples used in this section:
% Exp19753 - BW Floor Adjustment - SkypeVideoLibrary - Platforms 0,3 - https://ecs.skype.com/?page=ExperimentPage&type=Experiment&id=19753 -- Correlation Bias -- to be called Bandwidth
