    The LLM avoids collisions that would occur from directly moving to the pinching pose by planning a collision-free method during steps 6 - 7, demonstrating active collision avoidance. Additionally, the LLM proactively generates code to account for potential collisions with the drawer when performing free motion in the compact workspace, as illustrated in the bottom part.}
    % This highlights the effectiveness of our dynamic collision management.
    \label{fig:planner_pipline}
