As the MOT20Det dataset only provides designated training and testing sets, we further split the official training sequences into 4/5 for training and 1/5 for validation. The official testing sequences are reserved exclusively for final evaluation. 
For the BOAT360 dataset, we divide the collected video sequences into 3/5 for training, 1/5 for validation, and 1/5 for testing.

