This problem can be modeled by an $N$-player (agent) competitive MAB problem to explore and share $K$-armed bandits (resources), where $K> N$ (e.g., \cite{rosenski2016multi,besson2018multi,krishnasamy2021learning,mansour2022bayesian}).
