\section{Methodology}\label{section:3}
% This work aims to assess the validity of adversarial examples generated by existing algorithms against ML and DL-based NIDS. Unlike previous studies, we explicitly model and analyze domain constraints, including \textit{numerical} and \textit{categorical dependencies} in feature space, based on domain knowledge and data observations
