            \centering
            \includegraphics[width=1\linewidth]{Figures/mini_batch_clustets_annotated.png}
            \caption{Graph Node Clustering Using Mini-Batch K-Means (t-SNE) with Semantic Annotations}
            \label{fig:minibatch}
\end{figure}
\end{comment}
The performance evaluation of the various clustering algorithms are evaluated based on the Silhouette Scores and Davies-Bouldin Index (BDI) are shown in Table~\ref{tab:comparesilhouette} are as follows:
