In our second example, we use data from ERA5, a fifth-generation reanalysis dataset produced by the ECMWF that combines model data with global observations using the laws of physics to create a complete and consistent global climate and weather dataset. We obtained this data from the Climate Data Store (CDS)~\cite{cds_levels}.



