\subsection{Physical Setup}



Figure~\ref{fig:experimental_setup} shows the physical setup used for data collection, which included a local server (laptop), a Tobii Pro Nano eye tracker, a mobile phone stand, two smartphones, a table lamp, and a height-adjustable table. The Tobii Pro Nano was connected to the server via USB 3.0. The table height was adjusted for each participant to align the smartphone screen and eye tracker with the user’s eye level, supporting consistent data capture across participants.


\begin{figure}[ht]
    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.65\textwidth]{experimental_setup_cropped.pdf}
