Cardinal et al.~\cite{cardinal4} asked whether computing distances on general graph associahedra is \NP-hard. Very recently, this question was answered positively by Ito et al.~\cite{ito_et_al:LIPIcs.ICALP.2023.82}. %who proved that the problem is indeed \NP-hard.

