\subparagraph*{Our result.} The \NP-hardness result of Ito et al.~\cite{ito_et_al:LIPIcs.ICALP.2023.82} (see also~\cite{CardinalSteiner23}) paves the way for studying the parameterized complexity of the problem of computing distances on graph associahedra. Thus, in this article we are interested in the following parameterized problem, where we consider the natural parameter, that is, the desired distance. %\ig{maybe put the problem later?}
