 The SWellEx-96 dataset \cite{swellex96} has been widely adopted as a benchmark for evaluating the performance of underwater SSL methods across a wide spectrum of approaches, from traditional signal processing techniques to deep learning models such as CNNs and Transformers. Notable approaches include Chen et al. \cite{chencnnresults} with the extension of CNNs enhancing performance in challenging environments and Chi et al. \cite{feast} addresses overfitting using fitting-based early stopping (FEAST).
