%, using various topology types—including Crossbar, Mesh, Pt2Pt, Torus, FatTree, and Flattened Butterfly. The system setup includes a 64 KB L1D cache, a 2 MB L2 cache, 512 MB of memory, and a 64-byte cacheline size. It also features 4 virtual channels per port, credit-based flow control, and a 2 GHz operating frequency.

