When a single device lacks sufficient resources, collaborative edge computing enables multiple devices to function as a virtual edge server, distributing inference tasks dynamically~\cite{xue2020edgeld}. This cooperative framework balances computational load reduces latency, and enhances real-time responsiveness by leveraging shared computational resources across edge devices.

